        },
        {
          "dimension": "Liquidity",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "Mandatory 100% liquid-asset backing eliminates yield-generating reserve strategies, reducing the economic incentive to hold stablecoins for DeFi users who currently earn on collateral.",
